WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.946
Open a part on Products to see its vendors and their prices.

00:00:07.870 --> 00:00:13.489
Each vendor shows its price per piece, its MOQ in pieces, and its current inventory.

00:00:13.943 --> 00:00:16.547
The pencil lets you change these figures.

00:00:16.547 --> 00:00:18.198
Type them, and click Save.

00:00:22.259 --> 00:00:27.054
Add vendor adds another vendor with its price, and the bin removes a vendor from the part.

00:00:27.504 --> 00:00:33.007
Price history keeps every change of the customer price and the vendor prices, with when and who changed it.

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:48.680
On Vendors, a vendor's Parts tab lists the price of every part it supplies.
